        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="4" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="1. The Tourist taps the floating &quot;Ask the assistant&quot; button or opens the Chat page. A1." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="75" width="220" x="-110" y="90" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="5" parent="1" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shapeInside=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="2. The system checks that the chatbot is enabled and loads the history of the current chat session (if any). E1, A2." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="145" width="320" x="-160" y="225" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="6" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="3. The system shows the greeting &quot;Hello! What would you like to explore today?&quot; and suggested questions." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="220" x="-110" y="430" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="7" parent="1" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shapeInside=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="4. The Tourist types a question (1–1000 characters) or picks a suggestion and sends it. E2." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="130" width="320" x="-160" y="580" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="8" parent="1" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shapeInside=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="5. The client sends the question (with the location if permission was given or the question says &quot;near me&quot;); the Gateway rate-limits by IP and forwards it to the AI service. E3." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="175" width="320" x="-160" y="770" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="9" parent="1" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shapeInside=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="6. The AI service detects the language and intent, finds up to 5 matching tours / places (hybrid vector + graph search), calls the LLM once (Gemini, Groq as fallback) and keeps only citations that are in the search results. A3, E4." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="205" width="320" x="-160" y="1005" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="10" parent="1" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shapeInside=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="7. The system returns the answer progressively (streaming); citations appear as numbered links with a &quot;Sources&quot; list. A4, E5." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="145" width="320" x="-160" y="1270" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="11" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="8. The Tourist taps a source." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="220" x="-110" y="1475" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="12" parent="1" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=endState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#ff0000;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="40" width="40" x="-20" y="1625" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="13" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="E1. The chatbot is disabled → the floating button is hidden; the Chat page shows &quot;The chatbot is disabled&quot;. Session expired → the client starts an empty session." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="105" width="250" x="355" y="183" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="14" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="E2. Empty question or over 1000 characters → 422 &quot;Invalid question. Please enter 1 to 1000 characters.&quot;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="250" x="355" y="545" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="15" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="E3. Limit exceeded (5 turns / minute, 100 turns / day per IP) → 429 &quot;You have asked too many questions in a short time, please try again in …&quot;." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="105" width="250" x="355" y="743" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="16" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="E4. AI is busy (moderation has priority) or the Gemini quota is exceeded with no Groq → 429 &quot;The assistant is busy, please try again in …&quot;; every LLM provider fails or the gateway cannot reach AI → 503 &quot;The assistant is temporarily not responding, please try again later.&quot;; content blocked by the provider → a polite refusal." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="180" width="250" x="355" y="918" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="17" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="E5. Error mid-stream → &quot;The assistant hit an error while answering, please try again.&quot;; connection lost → &quot;Connection lost, the answer is incomplete.&quot;; the stream closes before any text → &quot;The assistant did not answer, please try again.&quot;; no Retry button (it appears only for errors before the stream starts: no network, 429, 503)." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="180" width="250" x="355" y="1153" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="18" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="A1. Full screen: from the floating chat panel choose &quot;Open full screen&quot; → the Chat page with the same session." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="220" x="-510" y="195" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="19" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="A2. New conversation: the Tourist chooses &quot;New conversation&quot;; the next question creates a new session." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="220" x="-910" y="400" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="20" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="A3.1. Out-of-scope question (weather, programming / maths, finance, politics, news, booking, prices, personal data) with no travel words → a canned answer, no LLM call." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="120" width="220" x="-1310" y="1240" as="geometry" />
